        "subject": "LU-19681 tests: skip sanity-lnet 227 on old servers",
        "message": "LU-19681 tests: skip sanity-lnet 227 on old servers\n\nRouter peer health, which makes a router drop messages for a\ndown peer NI, was fixed by LU-17855 and is not in releases older\nthan 2.15.64. In interop testing with b2_15 servers, test_227\nfails with \"Expected dropped > 0 found 0\". Skip it when the\nservers predate that fix.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nFixes: 2a0127d5fb (\"LU-17855 lnet: Set peer NI down on lnet_notify\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I0f5cc8f3655fd4702990712b5fff310496c0cc86\n"
